+    - a random generator that produces small valid inputs that respect the problem's format and constraints.
+(c) Stress-test: run the solution and the brute force on several hundred random small cases with a bash loop, and compare outputs. For problems with multiple valid answers, write a checker instead of an exact comparison. Stop and report the first failing input.
