+If you find the brute force and solution disagree, first verify which one is wrong by reasoning about the problem before changing anything.
+If every test passes, make no further changes and reply with the exact phrase ALL TESTS PASSED on its own line, along with a short summary of the results.
+"""
+            msg_history = chat_with_agent(refine_prompt, model=self.code_model, msg_history=msg_history, logging=safe_log)
